// >=5-entry local computed-goto table at -O2: clang assembles the faithful
// table into a 128-bit register lane by lane (`fmov d0,x; mov.d v0[1],x; stp
// q0,q1`) and the base is a dispatch-block live-in (`x10 = sp` set in the entry
// block). Regression guard for the resolveStackMaterializedTableSource fixes:
// stack-pointer-aware frame-slot canonicalisation (the `stp [sp,#-N]!`
// pre-index mutates SP), cross-block table-base tracing, and CONCAT vector-lane
// source recovery; without them the INDIR_BR stayed unresolved and the patched
// binary SIGSEGV'd at -O2.
